// Shared roster data (55 rats). Used by roster.html and the home page lineup.
const RATS = [{"n":"Beethowen","e":"Dark","r":"Bard","s":3,"t":"The Stormy Maestro","b":"A brooding genius who conducts every battle like a thunderous symphony. He scowls, he swings his baton, and somehow the whole party plays louder and hits harder with every bar.","img":"img/beethowen.webp","k":[["Movement","Each attack adds a stack of +4% damage to EVERY living ally (up to 10 stacks, +40% total). Stacks last 4s and refresh on every attack.\nBuilds on every attack. Stacks clear at the start of each wave."],["Ode to Joy","The stack is no longer cleared when a new wave starts, so you keep your bonus into the next fight. Stacks can still fall off if 4s pass without a refresh.\nAlways active once unlocked."],["Symphony No. 9","While the damage stack is full (10 stacks), every ally also gains +10% attack speed for 4s.\nRefreshed on each attack while the stack is full."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Dark ally gets +10% attack speed for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Boulder","e":"Earth","r":"Bard","s":1,"t":"The Mossy Gentle Giant","b":"Boulder has stood in one spot so long that moss and mushrooms grow on his shoulders. Slow, sleepy and impossible to move, he plants his staff and just keeps healing.","img":"img/boulder.webp?v=3","k":[["Rooted","Boulder's max HP is increased by 25% for the whole battle (he starts at full HP).\nAlways active."],["Deep Roots","Boulder regenerates 1.5% of his max HP every second while he is below full HP.\nEvery second."],["Bedrock","If Boulder has not been knocked back for 10s, his regeneration gets +1.5% max HP per second (3% per second in total).\nActive after 10s without being knocked back, and resets when he is."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Earth ally gets 15% less damage taken for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Burrow","e":"Earth","r":"Guardian","s":2,"t":"The Old Coal Miner","b":"Forty years underground taught Burrow one thing: once you dig in, you don't budge. His shovel blocks the hits and his armour only gets thicker the longer he holds his ground.","img":"img/burrow.webp?v=2","k":[["Dig In","Burrow takes 12% less damage while he is standing still (not walking).\nActive whenever he is not moving."],["Underground","The first hit Burrow takes in each wave deals 25% less damage.\nOnce per wave."],["Deep Den","The standing-still damage reduction rises from 12% to 20% (+8%).\nAlways active once unlocked."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Earth ally gets 15% less damage taken for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Catscourge & Pox","e":"Light","r":"Guardian","s":4,"t":"The Shevchenko Brothers","b":"The Shevchenko Brothers are skilled Cossack swordsmen from the Eastern Steppe. Answering the letters of their cousin Pip, they rode their squirrel steed Vlad halfway round the world's sewer systems to aid in the battle against Dr. Verminbane. The only thing more deadly than their four shishka blades is their dashing good looks.","img":"img/catscourge_and_pox.webp","k":[["Hopak Jump Dancing","The brothers leap over incoming blows: 20% chance to completely dodge an attack.\nAlways active."],["Squirrel Steed","After the brothers dodge an attack, Vlad carries them into a counter-charge: their next attack deals +60% damage.\nOne boosted attack per successful dodge."],["Death By a Thousand Cuts","Every attack has a 25% chance to make the target Bleed. Bleed deals 15% of the brothers' Attack every second for 5s, 75% of Attack in total. Hitting the same target again refreshes the Bleed, it does not stack.\nRolled on every attack."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Light ally takes 20% less damage whenever it is below 50% HP.\nActive only in the leader slot. Applies whenever a Light ally is below 50% HP."},{"n":"Cinder","e":"Fire","r":"Ranger","s":1,"t":"The Smouldering Sharpshooter","b":"Goggles up, slingshot loaded, tail smoking. Cinder is a hot-headed junkyard kid with flame-coloured hair and a shot that always lands where it hurts.","img":"img/cinder.webp","k":[["Hot Shot","Attacks deal +55% damage to enemies below 50% HP.\nApplies to every attack that meets the HP condition."],["Ashes to Ashes","Killing an enemy with a normal attack gives Cinder +15% attack speed for 3s. Another kill refreshes the timer, it does not stack.\nTriggers on every kill."],["Scorched Earth","The low-HP bonus damage rises from +55% to +70% (+15% more).\nAlways active once unlocked."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Fire ally gets +15% crit chance for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Cleorattra","e":"Light","r":"Guardian","s":4,"t":"Queen of the Nile","b":"Glamorous, clever and fiercely protective of her court. She sweeps onto the front line demanding every enemy's attention, while her royal fan wraps the weakest ally in a shimmering shield of sunlight.","img":"img/cleorattra.webp?v=2","k":[["Royal Entrance","At the start of each wave Cleorattra taunts: for 5s every enemy is forced to attack her.\nOnce at the start of each wave."],["Royal Fan","Shields the ally with the lowest HP percentage (possibly Cleorattra) for 45% of Cleorattra's Attack. The shield absorbs damage until it is used up or lasts 4s.\nEvery 3s, starting 3s into each fight."],["Blessing of Ra","Each shield also heals the same ally for 30% of Cleorattra's Attack.\nTriggers with every shield."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Light ally takes 20% less damage whenever it is below 50% HP.\nActive only in the leader slot. Applies whenever a Light ally is below 50% HP."},{"n":"Cobble","e":"Earth","r":"Artillerist","s":1,"t":"The Living Cobblestone","b":"A hulking heap of street cobbles that woke up one day and decided to fight. When it hurls its rubble, the stones scatter into the next enemy in line.","img":"img/cobble.webp?v=2","k":[["Scatter Shot","Every attack has a 35% chance to also strike a different random living enemy for 60% of the damage the first hit dealt.\n35% chance on each attack. At 1.2s between attacks that is about one trigger every 3.4s."],["Rubble","The chance to also hit a second enemy rises from 35% to 45%. The second hit still deals 60% of the first hit's damage.\n45% chance on each attack. At 1.2s between attacks that is about one trigger every 2.7s."],["Avalanche","If the second (cleave) hit kills its target, Cobble's attack cooldown is cut by 30%, so the next attack comes sooner.\nTriggers on each kill made by the second hit."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Earth ally gets 15% less damage taken for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Confuscheese","e":"Light","r":"Ranger","s":3,"t":"The Wise Archer","b":"A calm old teacher who believes a steady mind makes a steady aim. His quiet wisdom helps the whole party find their mark.","img":"img/confuscheese.webp","k":[["Wisdom Shared","Gives EVERY ally +10% hit chance for 5s.\nEvery 3s, starting 3s into each fight. The buff lasts longer than the timer, so it stays up."],["Golden Rule","When an ally dodges an attack, that ally is healed for 30% of Confuscheese's Attack.\nTriggers on every ally evade."],["Analects","The party hit chance buff rises from +10% to +15% (+5%).\nAlways active once unlocked."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Light ally takes 20% less damage whenever it is below 50% HP.\nActive only in the leader slot. Applies whenever a Light ally is below 50% HP."},{"n":"Count Ratcula","e":"Dark","r":"Bard","s":5,"t":"The Vampire Count","b":"A fanged count of the night with wings like a giant bat. Every blow he lands drains a little life back into him.","img":"img/ratcula.webp?v=2","k":[["Crimson Thirst","Count Ratcula heals himself for 25% of the damage he deals with each attack.\nEvery attack."],["Bloodlust","Each kill adds a stack of +4% damage to Count Ratcula (up to 10 stacks, +40% total). Stacks last 6s and the timer refreshes on each kill.\nTriggers on every kill. Stacks clear at the start of each wave."],["Undying Thirst","While Count Ratcula is at or below 30% HP his lifesteal gains +20% (45% of damage dealt in total).\nActive whenever his HP is at or below 30%."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Dark ally gets +10% attack speed for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Dawn","e":"Light","r":"Bard","s":2,"t":"The Sunrise Dancer","b":"She whirls onto the field on a cloud of sunrise with flowers in her hair. From behind the line her dance warms the whole party: wounds close, aim sharpens, and one lucky ally hits harder with every new morning.","img":"img/dawn.webp?v=2","k":[["Rising Sun","Gives one random living ally (possibly Dawn) +15% damage for 4s.\nEvery 4s, starting 4s into each fight."],["Morning Light","Heals the ally with the lowest HP percentage for 40% of Dawn's Attack.\nEvery 4s, starting 4s into each fight."],["Daybreak","Gives EVERY ally +10% hit chance for 5s.\nEvery 4s, starting 4s into each fight. The buff lasts longer than the timer, so it stays up."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Light ally takes 20% less damage whenever it is below 50% HP.\nActive only in the leader slot. Applies whenever a Light ally is below 50% HP."},{"n":"Edgar Allan Paw","e":"Dark","r":"Ranger","s":5,"t":"The Gloomy Poet","b":"A melancholy marksman with a raven on his shoulder and a crossbow shaped like black wings. Once a foe is wounded, nevermore will it escape.","img":"img/edgar_allan_paw.webp","k":[["Nevermore","Attacks against enemies at or below 30% HP have a 25% chance to kill them outright. The kill ignores shields. Bosses are immune.\nRolled on every attack made against a low-HP enemy."],["Tell-Tale","The execute threshold rises from 30% to 40% HP. Attacks against enemies at or below 40% HP still have a 25% chance to kill them outright (ignores shields, bosses are immune).\nRolled on every attack made against a low-HP enemy."],["Raven","When Edgar Allan Paw executes an enemy, he gains +15% attack speed for 4s.\nTriggers on each execute kill. Re-triggering refreshes the timer, it does not stack."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Dark ally gets +10% attack speed for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Ember","e":"Fire","r":"Artillerist","s":1,"t":"The Chimney Sweep","b":"A cocky rooftop sweep who knows every chimney in the city. One swipe of her sooty brush sets a foe smouldering, and the fire spreads from one enemy to the next.","img":"img/ember.webp?v=3","k":[["Kindle","Every attack has a 40% chance to set the target alight with Ignite. Ignite deals 25% of Ember's Attack every second for 3s, 75% of Attack in total. Hitting the same target again refreshes the timer instead of stacking.\n40% chance on each attack. At 1.2s between attacks that is about one trigger every 3s."],["Spreading Flame","When Ignite runs out naturally (not if it is removed early) there is a 30% chance it jumps to another living enemy and starts again. The new Ignite is as strong as the original (25% of Attack per second for 3s).\nRolled once each time an Ignite ends. A jump can chain again when the new Ignite ends."],["Firestorm","Enemies that are burning from Ignite take +15% damage from EVERY attacker, not just Ember. This applies to Ignite from any rat on your team.\nActive for as long as an enemy is ignited."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Fire ally gets +15% crit chance for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Fidget","e":"Water","r":"Artillerist","s":2,"t":"The Restless Beach Kid","b":"Fidget physically cannot sit still. She bounces, twitches and hurls water balloons so fast she sometimes throws two at once.","img":"img/fidget.webp","k":[["Restless","Every attack has a 20% chance to hit the same target a second time instantly. The second hit deals 100% of the first hit's damage.\n20% chance on each attack. At 1.2s between attacks that is about one trigger every 6s."],["Can't Sit Still","Fidget attacks 8% faster for the whole battle.\nAlways active."],["Overactive","Double-hit chance rises from 20% to 30% (+10%).\nAlways active once unlocked."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Water ally gets +10% hit chance for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Flicker","e":"Fire","r":"Ranger","s":2,"t":"The Fire-Eater","b":"The star of the circus sideshow. He twirls a flaming torch in each paw and breathes a roaring cloud of fire at anyone who gets close.","img":"img/flicker.webp","k":[["Torch Toss","Every attack has a 30% chance to set the target alight with Ignite. Ignite deals 20% of Flicker's Attack every second for 3s, 60% of Attack in total. Hitting the same target again refreshes the timer instead of stacking.\n30% chance on each attack. At 0.9s between attacks that is about one trigger every 3s."],["Fire Breath","Whenever an enemy hits Flicker and he survives, he breathes fire back at them for 30% of his Attack. This damage ignores Defense.\nTriggers on every hit he takes."],["Juggling Act","Flicker attacks 15% faster while his own Ignite is burning on any enemy.\nActive while at least one of his Ignites is burning."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Fire ally gets +15% crit chance for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Frost","e":"Water","r":"Artillerist","s":1,"t":"The Snow-Day Champion","b":"Bundled up and full of mischief, Frost has never lost a snowball fight. Her ladle catapult lobs ice balls that slow enemies down until they freeze solid.","img":"img/frost.webp","k":[["Chill Blast","Every attack has a 40% chance to slow the target: its attack speed drops by 25% for 3s. Hitting it again refreshes the timer, it does not stack.\n40% chance on each attack. At 1.2s between attacks that is about one trigger every 3s."],["Deep Freeze","If an enemy is already slowed when hit, there is a 45% chance to freeze it solid (a stun) for 1.5s.\nRolled on every attack against an already-slowed enemy."],["Shatter","Frost deals +20% damage to frozen (stunned) enemies.\nActive while the target is frozen."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Water ally gets +10% hit chance for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Genghis Fang","e":"Light","r":"Ranger","s":2,"t":"The Steppe Warlord","b":"A proud warlord who fights for his horde. The more of his friends still standing beside him, the harder he hits.","img":"img/genghis_fang.webp","k":[["Horde","Genghis Fang deals +8% damage for each OTHER living ally on your team (3 allies alive = +24%).\nRecalculated on every attack."],["Conqueror","Killing an enemy gives Genghis Fang 15% less damage taken for 3s. Another kill refreshes the timer.\nTriggers on every kill."],["Vast Empire","The bonus per living ally rises from +8% to +12% (3 allies alive = +36%).\nAlways active once unlocked."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Light ally takes 20% less damage whenever it is below 50% HP.\nActive only in the leader slot. Applies whenever a Light ally is below 50% HP."},{"n":"Gnasher","e":"Fire","r":"Guardian","s":2,"t":"The Golden Grin","b":"A hooded brawler with a mouth full of solid gold teeth. He flashes that grin to taunt the nearest enemy into attacking him, then shrugs off the hits.","img":"img/gnasher.webp?v=2","k":[["Bright Guard","At the start of each wave Gnasher taunts: for 5s every enemy is forced to attack him.\nOnce at the start of each wave."],["Burning Resolve","Gnasher takes 20% less damage while his taunt is active.\nActive during the 5s taunt at the start of each wave."],["Flashpoint","When the enemy that was attacking Gnasher dies, he heals 20% of his max HP.\nTriggers when that enemy dies."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Fire ally gets +15% crit chance for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Halo","e":"Light","r":"Artillerist","s":5,"t":"The Watcher in the Rings","b":"A serene angel wrapped in golden rings full of watchful eyes. From far behind the line she marks the wicked for judgment and stuns them with bursts of holy light, and no ally falls on her watch.","img":"img/halo.webp?v=3","k":[["Smite","Every attack has a 35% chance to mark the target. A marked enemy takes +30% damage from EVERY ally for 4s. Hitting it again refreshes the mark, it does not stack.\nRolled on every attack."],["Radiance","Every attack has a 20% chance to stun the target for 1.5s.\nRolled on every attack."],["Last Light","Once per wave, if an ally would die, Halo revives them with 50% of their max HP instead.\nOnce per wave, resets when the next wave starts."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Light ally takes 20% less damage whenever it is below 50% HP.\nActive only in the leader slot. Applies whenever a Light ally is below 50% HP."},{"n":"Inspector","e":"Dark","r":"Ranger","s":3,"t":"The Case Cracker","b":"A dapper detective in a grey trench coat with a twirled moustache and a magnifying glass he never puts down. Every attack adds another clue to the case, and the longer it runs, the closer he gets to the truth.","img":"img/inspector.webp","k":[["Fingerprints","Each attack adds a stack of a mark to the target (up to 3). Each stack makes it take +4% damage from EVERY ally, so full stacks mean +12%. The mark lasts 6s and refreshes on each attack.\nBuilds on every attack."],["Closing In","Inspector gains +4% crit chance for every full 10s the wave has lasted (+20% after 50s).\nGrows steadily during a wave and resets when the next wave starts."],["Elementary","Inspector deals +7% damage for each different enemy that currently carries his mark (4 marked enemies = +28%).\nRecalculated on every attack."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Dark ally gets +10% attack speed for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Isaac Gnewton","e":"Earth","r":"Artillerist","s":5,"t":"The Gravity Genius","b":"A brilliant natural philosopher who discovered that apples fall, then built a cannon to make them fall on enemies. His shots pull foes together for a bigger crunch.","img":"img/isaac_gnewton.webp","k":[["Gravity Well","Every attack has a 25% chance to pull two other enemies toward each other for 0.35s, bunching them together.\n25% chance on each attack. At 1.2s between attacks that is about one trigger every 4.8s."],["Reaction","Enemies that were pulled together take +50% damage from the next hit they receive, from any ally.\nTriggers the first hit after each pull."],["Principia","The pull chance rises from 25% to 35% (+10%) and the pull gets stronger.\nAlways active once unlocked."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Earth ally gets 15% less damage taken for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Leif Whiskerson","e":"Water","r":"Ranger","s":4,"t":"The Viking Navigator","b":"A seasoned explorer who has charted every far-off shore. His harpoon crossbow always finds the furthest enemy, and the first hit on a new target lands extra hard.","img":"img/leif_whiskerson.webp","k":[["Uncharted","Leif Whiskerson has +20% hit chance while attacking the furthest enemy.\nActive whenever his target is the furthest enemy."],["Landfall","The first attack on a newly chosen target deals +35% damage.\nTriggers each time Leif Whiskerson switches to a new target."],["Discovery","The new-target bonus rises from +35% to +50% damage (+15%).\nAlways active once unlocked."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Water ally gets +10% hit chance for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Loam","e":"Earth","r":"Ranger","s":2,"t":"The Farmhand","b":"A big, steady farm woman who won't be pushed around by anything. Try to knock her back and her potato cannon answers with a rockslide.","img":"img/loam.webp","k":[["Heavy Frame","Loam has a 35% chance to ignore a stun or knockback.\nRolled on every stun or knockback aimed at him."],["Rockslide","Each time Loam resists a stun or knockback, every living enemy takes 30% of his Attack as damage.\nTriggers on every successful resist."],["Landslide","Stun and knockback resistance rises from 35% to 50% (+15%).\nAlways active once unlocked."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Earth ally gets 15% less damage taken for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Lumen","e":"Light","r":"Bard","s":1,"t":"The Lightbulb Wizard","b":"A sly little wizard whose staff ends in a glowing lightbulb. He keeps the dark away by wrapping whichever ally needs it most in a warm, bright shield.","img":"img/lumen.webp?v=3","k":[["Warm Glow","Shields the ally with the lowest HP percentage for 60% of Lumen's Attack. The shield absorbs damage until it is used up or lasts 4s.\nEvery 3s, starting 3s into each fight."],["Bright Ward","Allies deal +25% damage while they are holding a shield.\nActive while an ally has a shield."],["Overflow","When a shield runs out of time with value left on it, the ally is healed for 50% of the unused shield.\nTriggers when a shield expires unused."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Light ally takes 20% less damage whenever it is below 50% HP.\nActive only in the leader slot. Applies whenever a Light ally is below 50% HP."},{"n":"Marie Antoinettail","e":"Fire","r":"Bard","s":5,"t":"The Rococo Queen","b":"Extravagant, pampered and used to getting her way. Her royal decrees fire up her allies, and her hair holds a cheesecake at all times.","img":"img/marie_antoinettail.webp","k":[["Royal Decree","Gives one random living ally (possibly Marie Antoinettail) +20% damage for 4s.\nEvery 3s, starting 3s into each fight."],["Proclamation","The damage buff now goes to TWO different random allies at once.\nApplied with every Royal Decree."],["Golden Age","Allies who receive the damage buff also take 15% less damage for 4s.\nApplied with every Royal Decree."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Fire ally gets +15% crit chance for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Micelangelo","e":"Light","r":"Ranger","s":5,"t":"The Master Sculptor","b":"Covered in marble dust and driven by perfection. He studies each new subject before one precise first strike, and every finished piece only makes him work faster and hit harder.","img":"img/michelratgelo.webp","k":[["Sketch","The first attack on a newly chosen target deals +45% damage.\nEvery time Micelangelo switches to a new target."],["Studio","Killing an enemy with a normal attack gives Micelangelo +25% attack speed for 4s. Another kill refreshes the timer, it does not stack.\nTriggers on every kill."],["Masterstroke","Each kill with a normal attack adds a stack of +10% damage to Micelangelo (up to 10 stacks, +100% total). Stacks last 6s and the timer refreshes on each kill.\nTriggers on every kill. Stacks clear at the start of each wave."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Light ally takes 20% less damage whenever it is below 50% HP.\nActive only in the leader slot. Applies whenever a Light ally is below 50% HP."},{"n":"Mona Ratsa","e":"Dark","r":"Guardian","s":3,"t":"The Enigmatic Lady","b":"Nobody knows what she's thinking behind that smile. Her misty haze helps nearby allies slip out of harm's way.","img":"img/mona_ratsa.webp","k":[["Sfumato","Every ally gets +10% evade chance for the whole battle.\nAlways active."],["Timeless","Every 4s the whole team is healed for 6% of Mona Ratsa's Attack.\nEvery 4s, starting 4s into each fight."],["Masterwork","The evade chance given to allies rises from 10% to 15% (+5%).\nAlways active once unlocked."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Dark ally gets +10% attack speed for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Nibbles","e":"Earth","r":"Ranger","s":3,"t":"The Snack Fiend","b":"Nibbles never stops eating. He goes after the weakest enemy first, and every knockout earns him a snack and a burst of speed.","img":"img/nibbles.webp?v=2","k":[["Quick Bite","Nibbles deals +40% damage when his target is the lowest-HP enemy on the field.\nChecked on every attack."],["Snack Time","Killing an enemy with a normal attack gives Nibbles +15% attack speed for 3s. Another kill refreshes the timer, it does not stack.\nTriggers on every kill."],["Second Helping","The bonus against the lowest-HP enemy rises from +40% to +60% (+20%).\nAlways active once unlocked."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Earth ally gets 15% less damage taken for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Onyx","e":"Dark","r":"Guardian","s":1,"t":"The Junk Knight","b":"A stubborn street kid in a cooking-pot helmet, swinging a bat behind a trash-can-lid shield. Hit him hard and he hits right back.","img":"img/onyx.webp?v=2","k":[["Trashcan Armor","Critical hits against Onyx deal 40% less damage.\nApplies to every critical hit taken."],["Baseball Bat Parry","When Onyx is hit by a critical hit he parries and strikes back for 60% of his Attack.\nTriggers on every critical hit taken."],["Immovable","Critical hit damage reduction rises from 40% to 55% (+15%).\nAlways active once unlocked."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Dark ally gets +10% attack speed for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Pipsqueak","e":"Light","r":"Guardian","s":3,"t":"The Original Rat","b":"Your very first recruit and the one who never leaves. Tough, loyal and a little rough around the edges, Pipsqueak guards his friends and refuses to go down.","img":"img/pipsqueak.webp","k":[["Steadfast","Every attack has a 35% chance to slow the target: its attack speed drops by 20% for 3s. Hitting it again refreshes the timer, it does not stack.\n35% chance on each attack. At 1.4s between attacks that is about one trigger every 4s."],["Never Alone","When any ally drops below 30% HP, Pipsqueak takes 20% less damage for 4s.\nTriggers once an ally is below 30% HP. Will not re-trigger while it is active."],["Old Friend","Once per wave, a hit that would kill Pipsqueak leaves him on 1 HP instead.\nOnce per wave, resets when the next wave starts."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Light ally takes 20% less damage whenever it is below 50% HP.\nActive only in the leader slot. Applies whenever a Light ally is below 50% HP."},{"n":"Ratana","e":"Water","r":"Guardian","s":3,"t":"The Twin-Blade Duelist","b":"A disciplined samurai-era warrior who always strikes twice. She steps to the front, calls every enemy to her, and answers each blow with both blades.","img":"img/ratana.webp","k":[["Twin Blades","Every attack has a 25% chance to hit the same target a second time instantly. The second hit deals 100% of the first hit's damage.\n25% chance on each attack."],["Challenge","At the start of each wave Ratana taunts: for 5s every enemy is forced to attack her.\nOnce at the start of each wave."],["Riposte","Ratana takes 20% less damage while her taunt is active.\nActive while her taunt lasts."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Water ally gets +10% hit chance for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Ratankhamun","e":"Water","r":"Guardian","s":5,"t":"The Boy Pharaoh","b":"Eternal guardian of the tomb. Every ally who falls only hardens his resolve, and his armour grows with each one.","img":"img/ratankhamun.webp","k":[["Tomb Guard","Ratankhamun takes 8% less damage for every ally that has fallen this wave (2 fallen allies = 16% less).\nGrows as allies fall, resets each wave."],["Sealed Chamber","Once 2 or more allies have fallen in the current wave, critical hits against Ratankhamun become normal hits.\nActive from the moment 2 allies have fallen until the wave ends."],["Eternal Rest","The reduction per fallen ally rises from 8% to 12% (2 fallen allies = 24% less).\nAlways active once unlocked."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Water ally gets +10% hit chance for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Ratbert","e":"Fire","r":"Artillerist","s":5,"t":"The Mad Inventor","b":"Wild hair, scorched lab coat, endless experiments. His Tesla cannon's sparks leap from one enemy to the next.","img":"img/ratbert.webp","k":[["Spark","Every attack has a 35% chance to also strike a different random living enemy for 75% of the damage the first hit dealt.\n35% chance on each attack. At 1.2s between attacks that is about one trigger every 3.4s."],["Invention","When the attack chains to a second enemy, there is a 35% chance to stun that enemy for 1.5s.\nRolled each time the chain lands."],["Eureka","The chain can continue to a third enemy, which takes 75% of the first hit's damage.\nHappens every time the chain to the second enemy lands."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Fire ally gets +15% crit chance for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Ratchet","e":"Earth","r":"Artillerist","s":4,"t":"The Wind-Up Mechanic","b":"A gruff tinkerer with a clockwork mortar on his shoulder. Every shot cranks the spring tighter, so each blast hits harder than the last.","img":"img/ratchet.webp","k":[["Wind Up","Each attack adds a stack of +9% damage (up to 10 stacks, +90% total). Stacks last 4s and the timer refreshes on every attack. A missed attack resets all stacks.\nBuilds on every attack. If 4s pass with no stack gained, all stacks fall off. Stacks also clear at the start of each wave."],["Tighten","The stack limit rises from 10 to 15, so the damage bonus can reach +135% instead of +90%.\nAlways active once unlocked."],["Full Torque","While at the maximum of 15 stacks, each attack also splashes 60% of its damage onto every other living enemy.\nActive on every attack while the stack is full."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Earth ally gets 15% less damage taken for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Ratcrates","e":"Dark","r":"Bard","s":2,"t":"The Street Philosopher","b":"A scruffy old rat who wanders barefoot asking annoying questions. By the time he's done, enemies doubt themselves and hit softer.","img":"img/ratcrates.webp","k":[["Questioning","Every attack has a 40% chance to weaken the target: it deals 20% less damage for 4s. Hitting it again refreshes the timer, it does not stack.\n40% chance on each attack. At 1s between attacks that is about one trigger every 2.5s."],["Known Unknowns","The whole team has +15% hit chance against enemies that carry any negative effect (burn, poison, mark, slow or stun).\nActive while the target has a debuff."],["Wisdom","The damage reduction lasts 2s longer (6s instead of 4s).\nAlways active once unlocked."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Dark ally gets +10% attack speed for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Ratcules","e":"Earth","r":"Guardian","s":4,"t":"The Mighty Hero","b":"Boastful, cheerful and absurdly strong under his lion-pelt hood. Every enemy he defeats makes him stronger, until his blows start knocking foes senseless.","img":"img/ratcules.webp","k":[["Twelve Labors","Each attack adds a stack of +7% damage (up to 10 stacks, +70% total). Stacks last 5s and the timer refreshes on every attack.\nBuilds on every attack. If 5s pass with no stack gained, all stacks fall off. Stacks also clear at the start of each wave."],["Herculean","Once Ratcules has 3 or more stacks, each attack has a 30% chance to stun the target for 1.5s.\n30% chance on each attack. At 1s between attacks that is about one trigger every 3.3s. Only while stacks are at 3 or more."],["Immortal","The stack is no longer cleared when a new wave starts, so you keep your bonus into the next fight. Stacks can still fall off if 5s pass without a refresh.\nAlways active once unlocked."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Earth ally gets 15% less damage taken for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Ratero","e":"Fire","r":"Artillerist","s":2,"t":"The Fiddling Emperor","b":"A pampered little emperor who thinks he's the greatest musician alive. When he plays, the whole battlefield catches fire.","img":"img/ratero.webp","k":[["Burn It Down","Every attack has a 25% chance to start a damage zone on the target and every other living enemy. The zone deals 20% of Ratero's Attack every second for 3s, 60% of Attack in total per enemy. Hitting the same enemy again refreshes the timer.\n25% chance on each attack. At 1.2s between attacks that is about one trigger every 4.8s."],["Fiddle While It Burns","Ratero attacks 15% faster while ANY enemy on the field is burning.\nActive as long as at least one enemy is burning."],["Great Fire","Ratero's zone damage rises from 20% to 30% of Attack per second (+10%).\nAlways active once unlocked."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Fire ally gets +15% crit chance for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Ratgellan","e":"Water","r":"Ranger","s":4,"t":"The Round-the-World Captain","b":"A dashing explorer who has sailed every sea. His musket always hunts the furthest enemy on the field.","img":"img/ratgellan.webp","k":[["Circumnavigate","Ratgellan always attacks the enemy that is furthest away.\nAlways active."],["Uncharted Waters","The first attack on a newly chosen target deals +35% damage.\nTriggers each time Ratgellan switches to a new target."],["Around the World","The new-target bonus rises from +35% to +50% damage (+15%).\nAlways active once unlocked."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Water ally gets +10% hit chance for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Ratileo","e":"Dark","r":"Artillerist","s":2,"t":"The Rebel Stargazer","b":"A defiant astronomer who sees what others refuse to. His telescope fires comets that mark enemies so the whole team hits harder.","img":"img/ratileo.webp","k":[["Stargazer","Every attack has a 35% chance to mark the target. A marked enemy takes +25% damage from EVERY ally for 4s. Hitting it again refreshes the mark.\n35% chance on each attack. At 1.2s between attacks that is about one trigger every 3.4s."],["Observation","Marked enemies take +35% damage from all allies instead of +25% (+10% more).\nAlways active once unlocked."],["Heresy","Ratileo deals an extra +25% damage to enemies carrying HIS mark (on top of the damage everyone gets).\nActive while the target is marked by Ratileo."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Dark ally gets +10% attack speed for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Ratjamin Franklin","e":"Water","r":"Bard","s":5,"t":"The Inventor Statesman","b":"A jolly grandfather of invention with a kite always overhead. The music of his glass armonica heals and shields his friends.","img":"img/ratjamin_franklin.webp","k":[["Glass Armonica","Heals the ally with the lowest HP percentage for 50% of Ratjamin Franklin's Attack.\nEvery 3s, starting 3s into each fight."],["Poor Richard's Remedy","The heal rises from 50% to 75% of Ratjamin Franklin's Attack.\nEvery 3s, starting 3s into each fight."],["An Ounce of Prevention","Every heal also gives the healed ally a shield worth 35% of Ratjamin Franklin's Attack for 5s.\nTriggers with every heal."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Water ally gets +10% hit chance for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Ratoleon Bones","e":"Fire","r":"Ranger","s":4,"t":"The Little Emperor","b":"Short in size, enormous in confidence. He marks targets for conquest and gets tougher with every enemy that falls.","img":"img/ratoleon_bones.webp","k":[["Mark for Conquest","Every attack has a 40% chance to mark the target. A marked enemy takes +20% damage from EVERY ally for 4s. Hitting it again refreshes the mark.\n40% chance on each attack. At 1.4s between attacks that is about one trigger every 3.5s."],["Old Guard","Each kill adds a stack of 5% damage reduction (up to 10 stacks, 50% total). Stacks last 6s and refresh on each kill.\nTriggers on every kill. Stacks clear at the start of each wave."],["Empire","Ratoleon Bones attacks 25% faster while any enemy is carrying his mark.\nActive as long as at least one enemy is marked."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Fire ally gets +15% crit chance for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Ratputin","e":"Dark","r":"Bard","s":4,"t":"The Mystic","b":"A wild-bearded wanderer with an unsettling stare. Enemies near him miss their swings, and he simply refuses to die.","img":"img/ratputin.webp?v=2","k":[["Unnerving Presence","Every enemy has 8% lower hit chance for the whole battle.\nAlways active."],["Hard to Kill","Once per wave, a hit that would kill Ratputin leaves him on 1 HP instead.\nOnce per wave, resets when the next wave starts."],["Resilience","After Ratputin survives a deadly hit, he heals 30% of his max HP over 3s.\nTriggers each time he cheats death (once per wave)."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Dark ally gets +10% attack speed for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Ratspeare","e":"Fire","r":"Bard","s":2,"t":"The Playwright","b":"A dramatic poet who treats every battle as opening night. His soliloquies grant the party a random buff, comedy or tragedy.","img":"img/ratspeare.webp","k":[["Soliloquy","Picks one at random: +15% attack speed, +15% damage or +15% crit chance, and gives it to EVERY ally for 4s.\nEvery 3s, starting 3s into each fight."],["Tragedy or Comedy","Instead of picking at random, the buff is always the one stat (attack speed, damage or crit chance) that the party currently has the least of.\nApplied with every Soliloquy."],["All the World's a Stage","Party buffs last 2s longer (6s instead of 4s).\nAlways active once unlocked."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Fire ally gets +15% crit chance for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Ratticus Aurelius","e":"Earth","r":"Bard","s":5,"t":"The Philosopher Emperor","b":"Calm, stoic and steady as stone. His meditations raise stone shields around the whole party.","img":"img/ratticus_aurelius.webp","k":[["Meditations","Shields EVERY ally for 30% of Ratticus Aurelius's Attack. Each shield absorbs damage until it is used up or lasts 4s.\nEvery 3s, starting 3s into each fight."],["Stoicism","Allies who are holding a shield have a 40% chance to ignore a stun.\nActive while an ally has a shield."],["Philosopher King","Party shields rise from 30% to 45% of Attack (+15%).\nAlways active once unlocked."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Earth ally gets 15% less damage taken for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Rattlesnout","e":"Fire","r":"Ranger","s":3,"t":"The Desert Gunslinger","b":"Cool as the desert night, she gives one warning shot and no second chances. Her shots weaken the enemy before she strikes.","img":"img/rattlesnout.webp","k":[["Warning Shot","Every attack has a 40% chance to poison the target with Poison. Poison deals 22% of Rattlesnout's Attack every second for 3s, 66% of Attack in total. Hitting the same target again refreshes the timer instead of stacking.\n40% chance on each attack. At 0.9s between attacks that is about one trigger every 2.2s."],["Coiled","Rattlesnout's first attack of every wave always applies Poison, no chance roll needed.\nOnce at the start of each wave."],["Strike","Rattlesnout deals +20% damage to enemies that are suffering from his own Poison.\nActive while the target is poisoned by Rattlesnout."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Fire ally gets +15% crit chance for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Ripple","e":"Water","r":"Ranger","s":1,"t":"The Bugler","b":"A bespectacled sea scout with a golden bugle. One blast sends a wave that knocks enemies right off their feet.","img":"img/ripple.webp?v=2","k":[["Current","Every attack has a 25% chance to knock the target back for 0.3s.\n25% chance on each attack. At 0.9s between attacks that is about one trigger every 3.6s."],["Undertow","The attack that knocks an enemy back also deals +50% damage.\nTriggers on each knockback."],["Riptide","Knockback chance rises from 25% to 35% (+10%).\nAlways active once unlocked."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Water ally gets +10% hit chance for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Sable","e":"Dark","r":"Guardian","s":2,"t":"The Cat Burglar","b":"A sly jewel thief who works by moonlight. She slips in close to slash with razor-edged cards, then vanishes before the counterattack lands.","img":"img/sable.webp","k":[["Night Strike","Attacks deal +30% damage to enemies above 70% HP.\nApplies to every attack that meets the HP condition."],["Shadow Step","Sable has a 12% chance to completely avoid each incoming attack.\nRolled on every attack aimed at Sable."],["Eclipse","After Sable dodges an attack, her next attack deals +30% damage.\nOne boosted attack per successful evade."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Dark ally gets +10% attack speed for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Scamper","e":"Earth","r":"Ranger","s":3,"t":"The Forest Scout","b":"A hyperactive scout who never stops moving. His reed blowgun fires fast and he's almost impossible to hit.","img":"img/scamper.webp","k":[["Quick Feet","Scamper attacks 10% faster for the whole battle.\nAlways active."],["Skitter","Scamper has a 12% chance to completely avoid each incoming attack.\nRolled on every attack aimed at Scamper."],["Dash","The attack speed bonus rises from +10% to +18% (+8%).\nAlways active once unlocked."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Earth ally gets 15% less damage taken for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Sir Rat-a-lot","e":"Fire","r":"Guardian","s":4,"t":"The Gallant Knight","b":"Chivalrous, brave and a little vain about his armour. He leaps in front of the most wounded ally and grows stronger when he saves them.","img":"img/sir_rat-a-lot.webp","k":[["Chivalry","At the start of each wave Sir Rat-a-lot taunts: for 5s every enemy is forced to attack him.\nOnce at the start of each wave."],["Noble Stand","Sir Rat-a-lot takes 20% less damage while his taunt is active.\nActive during the 5s taunt at the start of each wave."],["Knighted","Each time Sir Rat-a-lot is hit while taunting he gains +15% damage for 4s (refreshed by every hit).\nTriggers on every hit taken while the taunt is active."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Fire ally gets +15% crit chance for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Sniffer","e":"Earth","r":"Ranger","s":2,"t":"The Sniffly Tracker","b":"A bundled-up rat in a mossy green cloak who is always one sneeze away from disaster. His nose never stops running, but he can still sniff out the weakest enemy from across the battlefield.","img":"img/sniffer.webp?v=2","k":[["Track Scent","Sniffer always attacks the enemy with the lowest HP percentage, no matter how far away it is.\nAlways active."],["Keen Nose","Sniffer has +10% hit chance for the whole battle.\nAlways active."],["Hot Trail","Because Sniffer always hunts the lowest-HP enemy, every one of his attacks deals +15% damage.\nApplies to every attack."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Earth ally gets 15% less damage taken for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Squall","e":"Water","r":"Artillerist","s":2,"t":"The Living Storm","b":"A gusty little rat who has weathered every squall. From the back line he hurls blasts of wind and rain that slow enemies down, splash onto their friends and now and then stop them dead in the eye of the storm.","img":"img/squall.webp?v=2","k":[["Eye of the Storm","Every attack has a 15% chance to stun the target for 1s.\nRolled on every attack."],["Downpour","Every attack has a 20% chance to also strike a different random living enemy for 60% of the damage the first hit dealt.\nRolled on every attack."],["Squall Line","Every attack has a 35% chance to slow the target: its attack speed drops by 20% for 3s. Hitting it again refreshes the timer, it does not stack.\nRolled on every attack."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Water ally gets +10% hit chance for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Squeakeasy","e":"Water","r":"Bard","s":3,"t":"The Speakeasy Saxophonist","b":"He runs the smokiest speakeasy on the harbourfront and plays a mean saxophone. Between solos he quietly lifts the armour right off his rivals and hands it to his crew.","img":"img/squeakeasy.webp","k":[["Sticky Fingers","Every attack has a 45% chance to steal armor: the target takes +15% damage and Squeakeasy takes 15% less damage, both for 4s.\n45% chance on each attack. At 1.0s between attacks that is about one trigger every 2.2s."],["On the House","The stolen armor also protects one random other living ally: 15% less damage taken for 4s.\nTriggers every time armor is stolen."],["Last Call","Enemies that currently have their armor stolen deal 15% less damage.\nActive while the steal debuff lasts."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Water ally gets +10% hit chance for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Tinkle","e":"Light","r":"Bard","s":1,"t":"The Bedtime Bell-Ringer","b":"A sleepy kid in pyjamas who drags a brass bell twice his size everywhere he goes. Every clang rings a little faster, and the whole party speeds up to keep the beat.","img":"img/tinkle.webp?v=3","k":[["Crescendo","Each attack adds a stack of +5% attack speed to EVERY living ally (up to 10 stacks, +50% total). Stacks last 4s and refresh on every attack.\nBuilds on every attack. Stacks clear at the start of each wave."],["Encore","The stack is no longer cleared when a new wave starts, so you keep your bonus into the next fight. Stacks can still fall off if 4s pass without a refresh.\nAlways active once unlocked."],["Symphony","While the attack speed stack is full (10 stacks), every ally also gains +10% damage for 4s.\nRefreshed on each attack while the stack is full."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Light ally takes 20% less damage whenever it is below 50% HP.\nActive only in the leader slot. Applies whenever a Light ally is below 50% HP."},{"n":"Twitch","e":"Water","r":"Ranger","s":2,"t":"The Sewer Scavenger","b":"Paranoid, jumpy and impossible to pin down. He dodges incoming hits and fires his pipe launcher faster every time he's spooked.","img":"img/twitch.webp?v=2","k":[["Jumpy","Twitch has a 15% chance to completely avoid each incoming attack.\nRolled on every attack aimed at Twitch."],["On Edge","Each time Twitch dodges an attack he gains +15% attack speed for 3s. Dodging again refreshes the timer.\nTriggers on every successful evade."],["Nerves","Evade chance rises from 15% to 25% (+10%).\nAlways active once unlocked."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Water ally gets +10% hit chance for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Umbra","e":"Dark","r":"Artillerist","s":1,"t":"The Void Gunner","b":"A moody gunner whose cannon crackles with dark energy. Her shots stack up on enemies until they burst.","img":"img/umbra.webp?v=2","k":[["Void Shot","Each attack adds a stack of a mark to the target (up to 3). Each stack makes it take +10% damage from EVERY ally, so full stacks mean +30%. The mark lasts 5s and refreshes on each attack.\nBuilds on every attack."],["Consuming Dark","When an attack brings a target to 3 stacks, the mark explodes: every OTHER living enemy takes 40% of Umbra's Attack as true damage (ignores defense). The target's stacks then drop back to 1.\nTriggers each time a target reaches 3 stacks."],["Starless Night","Umbra deals +10% damage for each different enemy that currently carries his mark (4 marked enemies = +40%).\nRecalculated on every attack."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Dark ally gets +10% attack speed for the whole battle.\nActive only in the leader slot. Always on from the start of each battle."},{"n":"Vincent Van Gnaw","e":"Light","r":"Artillerist","s":4,"t":"The Starry Painter","b":"A passionate artist lost in colour and starlight. His paint-tube cannon splashes swirling Starry Night zones that keep hurting enemies.","img":"img/vincent_van_gnaw.webp","k":[["Starry Shot","Every attack has a 25% chance to start a damage zone on the target and every other living enemy. The zone deals 15% of Vincent Van Gnaw's Attack every second for 3s, 45% of Attack in total per enemy. Hitting the same enemy again refreshes the timer.\n25% chance on each attack. At 1.2s between attacks that is about one trigger every 4.8s."],["Brushstroke","Vincent Van Gnaw attacks 15% faster while his own zone is burning on any enemy.\nActive as long as at least one enemy is burning from his zone."],["Masterpiece","Zone damage grows by 8% of its tick damage for every second that zone has been burning on an enemy (for example +40% after 5s), up to +100%. Hitting the enemy again keeps the same zone burning, so the growth carries on; it starts again from zero only once the zone has burned out.\nGrows continuously while the zone is active."]],"a":"While this rat is in the leader slot, every Light ally takes 20% less damage whenever it is below 50% HP.\nActive only in the leader slot. Applies whenever a Light ally is below 50% HP."}];
// Always alphabetical by name, so a renamed rat lands in the right place without re-ordering the list by hand.
RATS.sort((a,b)=>a.n.localeCompare(b.n,"en",{sensitivity:"base"}));
